raph","text":"みり愛と私の5人(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段高いヒールを履かない上に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高所恐怖症なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"階段降りる姿が不恰好だったかと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いますがお許しください。。。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/12/19/9782654/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブノートをチラッと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えることがたくさんあるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノートにまとめたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれの覚え方で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必死に頭に詰め込んでます！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥ちゃんから昨日のライブ前にね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか途中スクリーンでかりんが抜かれて、それがすごい笑顔で、楽しそうにしてるかりん観たらめっちゃ涙でた（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今日もいっぱいたのしんでね（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って来てすごい嬉しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自分の笑顔嫌いなんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいって気持ちが伝わっているなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったなあ～～って思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/12/19/9782654/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山